`F(ω(t)) - F(ω(0)) = ∫_0^t ∇F(ω(s)) d^π ω(s) + ½ [∇F(ω), ω]_π(t)`. -/
theorem theorem_5_1 (hω : ContinuousOn ω (Icc 0 T)) (hQV : HasQuadraticVariation π ω)
